// (x1 - 1 - bx) | (right - 1 - x0) | (y1 - 1 - by) | (bottom - 1 - y0): negative when the record misses the tile
add (1|M0)               r8.3<1>:ud    r40.3<0;1,0>:ud   -r2.0<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.3<1>:ud    r8.3<0;1,0>:ud    0xffffffff:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r2.2<0;1,0>:ud    -r40.1<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud    0xffffffff:ud
or (1|M0)                r8.3<1>:ud    r8.3<0;1,0>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r40.4<0;1,0>:ud   -r2.1<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud    0xffffffff:ud
or (1|M0)                r8.3<1>:ud    r8.3<0;1,0>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r2.3<0;1,0>:ud    -r40.2<0;1,0>:ud
add (1|M0)               r8.4<1>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud    0xffffffff:ud
or (1|M0)                r8.3<1>:ud    r8.3<0;1,0>:ud    r8.4<0;1,0>:ud
cmp (16|M0)  (lt)f0.1    null:d        r8.3<0;1,0>:d     0:d
