add (8|M0)               r38.0<1>:ud   -r7.0<8;8,1>:ud   r8.1<0;1,0>:ud
or (8|M0)                r10.0<1>:ud   r10.0<8;8,1>:ud   r38.0<8;8,1>:ud
and (1|M0)               r8.2<1>:ud    r40.0<0;1,0>:ud   0x7f:ud
cmp (16|M0)  (eq)f0.1    null:ud       r8.2<0;1,0>:ud    0:ud
